<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman upgrades StanChart.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman upgrades StanChart.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said on Monday it had upgraded its recommendation on banking group Standard Chartered Plc to &quot;market performer&quot; from &quot;market underperformer&quot;.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
